SABOGAL BIO:
Sabogal is a Colombian-born music sensation who has taken the Southern California nightlife scene by storm. With an unparalleled ability to read a crowd and keep the energy high, SABOGAL has quickly become a sought-after DJ for events and clubs in Orange County, Los Angeles and even as far as Las Vegas, and Mexico. Born and raised in Colombia, SABOGAL developed a passion for music at a young age, inspired by the rich sounds of Latin America. As a teenager, SABOGAL discovered a love for electronic music and began experimenting with mixing and producing. With a unique blend of Latin rhythms, House Music beats, and cutting-edge production techniques, SABOGAL’s music is a fusion of traditional and contemporary sounds that always get the party started. Whether performing at a small club or a massive event, SABOGAL brings an infectious energy and a love of music that keeps the crowd dancing all night long.

With his Colombian background and international experience, SABOGAL is a true global ambassador for Electronic and Latin music, and a rising star in the industry. So if you''re looking for an unforgettable night of music and dancing, be sure to catch SABOGAL at his next show in Orange County, Los Angeles and beyond!','2026-08-19T04:42:32.649612+00:00',3069.0,ARRAY['ayybo','beats and beans','coffee and matcha','coffee party','dj set','dombresky','eddy m','house music','huntington beach','inc coffee roasters','jazz house','live dj set','luke alessi','matcha','quiliano','sabogalmusik','super flu','tom fills','young franco']::text[],2160,'9a3c884a-3152-504c-b67e-1d7871f102a7','business','en',3,'2026-08-19T04:42:34.711312+00:00','youtube','WWqSuDZU-3s','2025-07-09T18:22:52+00:00','unlicensed_reference','"Inc Coffee Roasters" Orange County','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WWqSuDZU-3s/maxresdefault.jpg','House Music Coffee Party - Beats and Beans Huntington Beach','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WWqSuDZU-3s',208,3840),
