('cbf41cad-7ad6-55ae-a676-646a1d2b31aa','youtube:TdoAqEmTwHc',10,'ytdlp','Shari Laverde',764,'@ShariLaverde','9b7e1cc2-3f7a-5243-9044-a165e6fd3455','#EmpanadasReview #LocalRestaurant #LagunaBeachCalifornia #ShariLaverde 

In this quick video I provide my honest empanadas review from a local restaurant in Laguna beach, California. Since we moved to Laguna beach my family and I have been vlogging our lives here and have been exploring all the family friendly beaches, restaurants and all this beautiful beach city has to offer. 

Recently we decided to stop by Sergio''s Empanadas Restaurant and bought a dozen of empanadas. We got both chicken and beef with Chimichurri sauce. If you are looking for quick bite to eat in Laguna beach, this is a great place to go and grab a quick empanada and drink for a reasonable price. They also sell our favorite cookies "Alfajores". They are popular Latin American sugar cookie filled with dulce de leche and coconut flakes. One of our favorite cookies. 

Watch the full video for honest empanadas review. 
Don''t forget to like, comment and subscribe for more videos. 🌸

