('0ed3a9c3-d551-538a-9dff-cdbe37fadb51','youtube:p-74nT3BVvM',5,'ytdlp','EpicureanRd. - Where to go, What to eat',143000,'@steveandyoung','09260aeb-dc7b-586e-a3cd-c4814cde868a','Welcome to Little France Coffee & Bakery in beautiful Mission Viejo, CA! Join us for an unforgettable experience as we indulge in an authentic French breakfast like you''ve never experienced before. At Little France, they serve the finest and most delicious French pastries, bread, and coffee. 

Start your day off right by immersing yourself in the rich flavors of their freshly baked croissants, made with love by their skilled bakers following traditional French recipes. Crispy on the outside and buttery on the inside, these little gems will transport you straight to the streets of Paris. 

Their menu also features a wide variety of mouthwatering options to satisfy all taste buds. This cozy café provides a welcoming atmosphere, reminiscent of an authentic French bistro. Whether you prefer a quiet morning alone with your coffee or a lively brunch with friends, this place will ensure that your experience is nothing short of exceptional. 

Located in the heart of Mission Viejo, the café offers an escape from the hustle and bustle of everyday life. Don''t miss out on the opportunity to savor an authentic French breakfast experience. Bon appétit!

If you like this video, please click on the burger in the lower right corner of the video to subscribe.

