('ddc24393-0e02-5076-9bd3-f768b2f51310','youtube:HfVdd3NB0Tg',27,'ytdlp','Lalit Devraj',2980,'@LalitDevraj','2db1df5d-5d8e-5ff9-8d3b-680bf5b7cdb2','Introducing the Newest Capital One Cafe 2023! With the Capital One Venture X, Venture Rewards, VentureOne, Quicksilver Rewards, Savor Rewards, SavorOne Rewards, QuicksilverOne Rewards and even your Capital One debit card, you get 50% off handcrafted beverages at the Capital One Café!

This is located in Frisco,Texas in the Stonebriar Centre Mall with 

Some frequently asked questions and answers are below:

-What is a Capital One Café?

A Capital One Café is a community space where you can come in - relax and recharge - whether you bank with us or not. You can grab a snack or handcrafted coffee or tea beverage, enjoy our cozy spaces, free Wi-Fi and outlets, chat with Café Ambassadors about local events or Capital One products and services, use our community room for non-profits and much more.

-Can I come to a Capital One Café if I’m not a customer?

Whether you bank with us or not, everyone is welcome to come relax and recharge at our Cafés. They’re truly a community space and here to support your everyday well-being.

-Will you try to sell me something at a Capital One Café?

Our Café Ambassadors are there to support you, not sell you. If you do have questions about products or services, they’re happy to answer them, but you can expect a sales free environment in all Capital One Cafés.

-What can you do at a Capital One Café?

There''s a lot to do at the Café. You can grab some food and a handcrafted coffee beverage, tea or other drinks, connect to our free Wi-Fi and outlets to get work done solo or with a colleague, chat with a Café Ambassador or Money & Life Mentor, use our non-profit room or semi-private nooks, and much more!

-Do Capital One Cafés have food or just coffee?

Cafés offer more than just coffee, tea and beverages. From sandwiches to snacks, there’s food to keep you full while you sit and work or if you’re just stopping in for a quick bite. Our Cafés also offer a full service coffee bar with handcrafted coffee and tea beverages and much more.

-Do Capital One Customers get perks at the Café?

While everyone can take advantage of all the things that Cafés have to offer whether you bank with us or not, Capital One customers do get 50% off handcrafted beverages every day when using a Capital One debit or credit card.

-Can I open an account at Capital One Café?

Yes, you can open accounts at a Capital One Café. Chat with a Café Ambassador and they can help you get you set up.

-How do I bank at a Capital One Café?

You can use our self-service banking options and 24/7 ATMs or you can bank with a Café Ambassador. Cafés do not have all the same services that branches do, so be sure to check what’s available at your location or call your nearest Café if you have specific questions.

-Are there ATMs at a Capital One Café?

Yes, there are self-service ATMs available at all Cafés that are available 24/7 and fee-free to Capital One customers. You can use them to deposit cash, deposit checks, pay your credit card bill and more. Not a customer? There’s a small fee to use the ATMs.

