('fb9dadb6-190d-59b3-be63-fbd914b76314','youtube:qA8fN_7W2_I',NULL,'ytdlp','Hot Wheels Cars, Tracks, Racing',881,'@hotwheelscarstracksracing6576','29f589d4-3964-5051-a02c-22ac79a15553','Too bad the wooden benches outside CPK which is now North Italian are gone but at least there are still more wooden benches, but anyways, before we left the mall, I wanted to take some footage of these wooden chairs that are owned by Nordstrom E-Bar as these chairs are just some furnishings that have been disappearing since the late 2010s so just in case these get replaced this year, I at least have a video of them but these will most likely be here but before I even saw these things, I was surprised to see these as all the other Nordstrom locations (other than Santa Monica Place) don''t have these any more. I am pretty sure that all the ones in Orange County don''t have these chairs as they were replaced with new furniture in the late 2010s. The cushions on these aren''t original as they were originally fax leather upholstery which is unfortunate however; the location at Fashion Show in Las Vegas does have these chairs with the original ones, but that''s all the way other there. These were installed in 2010 when this wind was built. It''s unclear if the floor tiles are original. This will be the last video at this location.

