('377fb899-1b58-51c9-a132-23750a5f583e','youtube:RffMy1uI6WE',NULL,'ytdlp','Honey Bee Tea',6,'@honeybeetea9682','4cdf6494-0463-507e-8099-611639640a82','Hi all, we are a family owned premium boba tea shop here in the West County area of St. Louis, MO in the city of Manchester next to Ballwin.  We only use the finest and freshest organic ingredients from Taiwan.  We do not use artificial powders, artificial syrup, or imitation fruit.  All our drinks use a combination of puree and real fruit and our tea is brewed fresh throughout the day.  

We sell many types of delicious Milk Tea including our signature Okinawa Milk Tea with toasted creme brulee.  We also have fresh smoothies, fruit tea, Vietnamese coffee, and matcha drinks, etc. Besides black boba we have 15 plus other toppings to choose from. This is a great place for you, your friends and family to hang out and have a tealicious time. 

I can''t wait to see you guys here, thank you so much for supporting us.

