('e792def0-13ad-5f95-8ed7-a142be6b5eae','youtube:thO4cFYDKuQ',3,'ytdlp','Per Diem',3730,'@tryperdiem','576ca3de-5666-5e68-81d3-0a9803ac1e75','Mobile ordering app, coffee shop branding, fast service — In this video, Coffee Dose founder Jeni Castro shares how she turned an 88-square-foot setup inside a hair salon into one of the boldest coffee brands in California. Known for cheeky branding, long lines, and loyal fans, Jeni explains how launching a custom mobile app with Per Diem changed the game for Coffee Dose.

With faster service, fewer lines, rich customer data, and custom design that keeps the brand’s voice intact, the app has become a critical part of their growth story. From push notifications to peak time insights, Jeni breaks down why tech + personality = scale.

➡️ Learn more about launching a mobile app for your coffee shop: https://tryperdiem.com

📍 Filmed at Coffee Dose – Costa Mesa, California

