('b3775915-1656-5f2d-99c3-4de7c309c983','youtube:8LbfP9St0iI',NULL,'ytdlp','Living in South Orange County by Holly McKhann',1120,'@hollymckhann','a3843614-9225-5a6d-a9a1-222f2ce45618','Holly McKhann featuring Sara Petersen, at Zebra House Coffee in San Clemente California. 

1001 S El Camino Real, San Clemente CA 92672
Hours of operation: 6:00am-4:00pm
orderzebrahousecoffee.com
www.zebrahousecoffee.com
doordash.com
(949) 218-6976

Zebra House Coffee has been around since 2011! Sara''s dream was to always have a shop with food and drinks... so they are a full service coffee shop AND cafe! They have a full breakfast, and lunch menu! Sara says you have to try their muffins. She also goes over a lot of the popular items and they all sound AMAZING.

Every month they feature a local artist in the shop. 

They recently remodelled and partnered with Moen Woodworks, a local business here in San Clemente.

She has maintained jobs throughout Covid-19, through out the crazy year 2020. IN FACT, she even HIRED during that time. 

There are MORE LOCATIONS for Zebra House Coffee coming soon! They have plans to build a location across from Target in that extension parking lot. It''s a great location, across from the sports park. Sara''s excited to be closer to Talega. 

