('d4cd289b-9fd3-5527-88ca-a9b1c348c4a3','youtube:JGNFx6ksobE',11,'ytdlp','June Ly',46,'@ItsJuneLy','2e434803-cf88-5daf-acb3-96f506d2d543','In this cafe hopping vlog, I''m joined by my friend Nat (aka NatteaBoba)! We visited some cute, aesthetic cafes in Orange County (OC) and part of Los Angeles County. Aside from having coffee and tea at the cafes, we also had fun taking cute pictures at a photobooth, cooled down with Korean shaved ice, and checked out a new Korean donut shop. Did I mention we also had Korean BBQ? Oh yesss we definitely had KBBQ! I hope you enjoyed this action-packed cafe hopping vlog!

Check out my friend Nat''s channel: https://www.youtube.com/c/NatteaBoba

Timestamps
0:00 - Cafe Hopping vlog intro
0:14 - Korean shaved iced
1:13 - Taking pictures at a photobooth
1:55 - Coffee & bread at Smoking Tiger cafe
3:07 - A cup of coffee at Flat White Coffee
4:30 - Artisan donuts + Retro shop vibes at Chubby Seoul Donuts
6:42 - Korean BBQ for lunch
7:30 - Aesthetic cafe shop vibes + Stationery + Plants

Locations mentioned
● MealTop (Buena Park, CA)
● FlipPoly (Buena Park, CA)
● Smoking Tiger Coffee & Bread (Buena Park, CA)
● Flat White Coffee (Cypress, CA)
● Chubby Seoul Donuts (Cerritos, CA)
● Baekjeong (Buena Park, CA)
● Thank You Coffee (Anaheim, CA)

