Iced Kobe

#coffee #specialtycoffee #coffeeroasters #mameya #mameyacoffee #mameyacoffeeroasters #lagunaniguel #orangecounty #california #커피 #스페셜티커피 #마메야 #마메야커피 #마메야커피로스터스 #라구나니겔 #오렌지카운티 #캘리포니아 #コーヒー #スペシャルティコーヒー #まめや #まめやコーヒー #まめやコーヒーロースター #ラグナニゲル #カリフォルニア

I visited Mameya Coffee Roasters on the recommendation of a friend who lives in Laguna Niguel.
Mameya Coffee Roasters is a coffee brand from Kobe, Japan, and this is their first branch in the United States.
More than a dozen different types of coffee beans are placed in front of the Coffee Roaster Machine, and they roast the beans to your desired roast level right on the spot.
I tried the Iced Kobe, and the coffee tasted smooth and good, but it had a slightly burnt taste, probably because they use beans roasted right in the store.
They have a variety of coffee beans, so next time l visit, l''ll have to try a different bean.
If you''re a coffee lover, I recommend you to try specialty coffee here.','2026-08-19T05:26:19.324136+00:00',202.0,ARRAY['california','coffee','coffeeroasters','lagunaniguel','mameya','mameyacoffee','mameyacoffeeroasters','orangecounty','specialtycoffee','まめや','まめやコーヒー','まめやコーヒーロースター','カリフォルニア','コーヒー','スペシャルティコーヒー','ラグナニゲル','라구나니겔','마메야','마메야커피','마메야커피로스터스','스페셜티커피','오렌지카운티','캘리포니아','커피']::text[],1080,'dedef336-9fdd-5c38-8b0b-226d801f4122','business','ko',3,'2026-08-19T05:26:22.381481+00:00','youtube','7ky1tVsdmTo','2025-02-04T23:31:09+00:00','unlicensed_reference','"Mameya Coffee Roasters" Laguna Niguel','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7ky1tVsdmTo/maxresdefault.jpg','Mameya Coffee Roasters, Laguna Niguel, California 마메야 커피 로스터스, 라구나 니겔','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7ky1tVsdmTo',180,1920),
