('777af271-e78c-530a-a27d-bd1d13cf8d0b','youtube:81BJP0wl1so',4,'ytdlp','Steph Does Fun Things',1840,'@Stephdoesfunthings','7d480e8c-5fda-5e5f-a444-c6a0f7c4b083','Join us as we explore three of the most talked-about coffee spots in OC:

Play Coffee – 100 N Orange St, Orange, CA 92866
A charming café housed in a former bank, offering unique drinks like the Volcano Latte and Matcha Tonic.

Hopper & Burr – 202 W 4th St, Santa Ana, CA 92701
Known for its artisanal approach and cozy atmosphere, perfect for sipping on a Campfire Cappuccino or Watermelon Slushe.

Stereoscope Coffee – 100 Bayview Cir Ste 1200, Newport Beach, CA 92660
A Newport Beach gem offering a variety of coffee and matcha drinks, including the Ultimate Breakfast Brioche Bun.

From iced lattes to matcha tonics, we indulged in a range of beverages that showcase our love for coffee. Each shop offers a unique experience, and I''m excited to share our journey with you! 


