('b2f96fc5-1db1-5de2-a353-cdb6441990ae','youtube:JzubWZun_DU',4,'ytdlp','CSC Luong',579,'@CSCLuong','bad6080c-a503-5d8c-85ad-ef3f1129548b','Lion dancing at Starz coffee shop in Orange County. The performance started off with lion dance out in the front of the coffee shop than enters the coffee shop to pray at the altar where the cashier is and walks around inside and back out from the front door. Once the lions are outside again it dances for the martial arts to start its show. When are the performance of martial arts did its performance, a single lion will come out and perform and dance around the watermelon. The lion will than bite the watermelon and pick it up with its mouth and hand it over to the business owner for good luck and prosperity of good fortune. After that the owner and employees of the coffee shop with take pictures with the lions, and end the show with some long fire crackers.














